// 관리종목사유 가져오기 - 처리절차가 107일때 코스닥 20170120
scwin.fn_getTrdHaltRsn = function() {
    dts_TrdHaltRsn.removeAll();
    var url = "/Viewer.do?method=getTrdHaltRsn&inputMessageId=VIEWER_TRD_HALT_RSN&outputMessageId=VIEWER_TRD_HALT_RSN" + "&ACPT_NO=" + scwin.gAcptNo;
    dts_TrdHaltRsn.DataID = encodeURI(url);
    dts_TrdHaltRsn.reset();
};
scwin.dts_TrdHaltRsn_OnLoadError = function() {
    $c.stf.alert_error(dts_TrdHaltRsn);
};
scwin.dts_TrdHaltRsn_OnLoadCompleted = function(rowcount) {
    scwin.gRsnYn = dts_TrdHaltRsn.getCellData(1, "RSN_YN");
    scwin.gEndYn = dts_TrdHaltRsn.getCellData(1, "END_YN");
};
